      "user": "Why does the ice change from solid to liquid then?",
      "assistant": "Heat gives the tiny water molecules energy to move and flow."
    },
    {
      "user": "What happens if we drop an apple on the warm grass?",
      "assistant": "The soft apple might get squished, but it will not melt like ice."
